Query 1: Whether the loans that are not classified as PSL on April 1, 2025 can be classified as PSL based on the revised parameters. 
Clarification: Priority Sector Lending (PSL) eligibility of loans outstanding as on April 1, 2025 shall be determined with reference to the 
